fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"applib/gstappsink.html#GstAppSinkProposeAllocationCallback","fragment":"\n\tGstAppSinkProposeAllocationCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkProposeAllocationCallback\n\n\n\tGstApp.AppSinkProposeAllocationCallback\n\nCalled when the propose_allocation query is available. This callback is\ncalled from the streaming thread.\nParameters:\na GstAppSink\nAn ALLOCATION query\ncallback user data\nTRUE when the query has been handled.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when the propose_allocation query is available. This callback is\ncalled from the streaming thread.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\nAn ALLOCATION query\ncallback user data\ntrue when the query has been handled.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\nCalled when the propose_allocation query is available. This callback is\ncalled from the streaming thread.\nParameters:\na GstApp.AppSink\nAn ALLOCATION query\ncallback user data\nTrue when the query has been handled.\n\n\tSince\t\t\t: 1.28\n\t\t\n"});